@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Seguridad en Servidor STOMP: WebSocketSecurityInterceptor (Rate Limiting y Payload)

actor "Cliente WebSocket" as Client
participant "Servidor SockJS / Tomcat" as Transport
participant "WebSocketSecurityInterceptor" as Interceptor
participant "JwtUtils" as JWTService
participant "SimpleBroker (STOMP)" as Broker

== 1. Autenticación en Handshake STOMP (Comando CONNECT) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: CONNECT\n[Cabecera: Authorization: Bearer <jwt>]
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> JWTService: validateJwtToken(jwt)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> Interceptor: true [Token íntegro y vigente]
deactivate JWTService

Interceptor -> JWTService: getUserNameFromJwtToken(jwt)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> Interceptor: username
deactivate JWTService

Interceptor -> Interceptor: accessor.setUser(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
Interceptor --> Broker: Permite conexión y asocia usuario a sesión
deactivate Interceptor

Broker --> Client: STOMP Frame: CONNECTED

== 2. Control de Frecuencia (Rate Limiting en SUBSCRIBE) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: SUBSCRIBE /topic/resource/{id}
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: checkRateLimit(username)
note right Interceptor
  Contador atómico por ventana de tiempo:
  Máximo 60 peticiones por minuto por usuario
  en ConcurrentHashMap en memoria.
end note

alt Tasa superada (> 60 msg/min)
    Interceptor --[#red]> Client: ERROR [Rate limit exceeded]
else Tasa dentro del umbral
    Interceptor --> Broker: Registra suscripción al tópico
end
deactivate Interceptor

== 3. Validación de Tamaño de Payload (Comando SEND) ==

Client -> Interceptor: STOMP Frame: SEND /app/endpoint\n[Payload JSON]
activate Interceptor

Interceptor -> Interceptor: payload.length <= 64 KB

alt Payload excede 64 KB
    Interceptor --[#red]> Client: ERROR [Payload size exceeds 64KB boundary]
    note right Interceptor
      Rechaza mensajes que superan el límite establecido de 64 KB.
    end note
else Payload válido
    Interceptor --> Broker: Enruta mensaje a controladores de aplicación
end
deactivate Interceptor

@enduml